            HAI 1.3
              O HAI IM first
                I HAS A marker ITZ "first"
                HOW IZ I show YR ignored
                  VISIBLE ME'Z marker
                IF U SAY SO
              KTHX
              O HAI IM second
                I HAS A marker ITZ "second"
                HOW IZ I show YR ignored
                  VISIBLE ME'Z marker
                IF U SAY SO
              KTHX
              I HAS A target ITZ first
              HOW IZ I retarget
                target R second
                FOUND YR 0
              IF U SAY SO
              I IZ target'Z show YR I IZ retarget MKAY MKAY
            KTHXBYE
            
